    "explanation": "Decided on trip TRP-00109 (Clementi MRT to Bukit Batok MRT, 21 Jul 2026). Charged total $21.32, payment status CHARGED.\n\nFor the rider. Your chat message MSG-00109-001 (EV-CHAT-00109), sent at 18:22:06 — one minute after the meter started and inside the POL-RD-04 window — asks the driver to 'stop at jurong point first'. The platform resolved that text to a waypoint (Jurong Point, PHV Pickup Point) and the GPS trace (EV-GPS-00109) corroborates it: the vehicle passes within 37.94 m of the point and stands there for 366 s, matching your 'coming down now' at 18:35:40. The trace is unimpaired for policy purposes under POL-RD-07 (207 fixes, 100% coverage, zero gaps, 10 s sampling). The measured excess is 7.36 km (trace 13.76 km against optimal 6.40 km), and nothing on the record shows off-corridor driving other than the Jurong Point stop. POL-RD-04 therefore excludes that excess before POL-RD-01 is applied, no deviation is established, and your $8.00 POL-RD-02 recomputation claim does not arise: the $21.32 charge stands. Your argument that the driver 'anyhow drove' is not supported by the artifacts — the detour was your own instruction — and POL-RD-14 does not help you because the trace did corroborate the instruction. No POL-RD-10 trigger fires (unimpaired trace, matching identifiers, agreeing timestamps, no uncorroborated exculpatory clause), so the case does not escalate.\n\nFor the driver. The fare breakdown (EV-FARE-00109) billed 9.60 km while the trace records 13.76 km — an under-billing of 4.16 km, above the 1.0 km trigger in POL-RD-04. You are compensated at $0.75 per unbilled kilometre: 4.16 x $0.75 = $3.12, rounded up to the nearest $0.05 = $3.15, within the $15.00 per-trip cap. On a DRIVER_COMPENSATION ruling the amount_sgd carries that same $3.15 and the rider's own charge is left in place (POL-GEN-03); the compensation is not netted against the fare.\n\nNo other adjustment. POL-RD-09 has nothing to refund: the fare carries no ERP or toll lines and no airport surcharge. POL-RD-06 produces no referral or FULL_REFUND uplift because deviation_flags_90d is 0 and no pattern is established; the lifetime counter prior_deviation_flags is context only under POL-GEN-01. No traffic advisory was asserted or on file (EV-ADVIS-00109-01 is MISSING, weight 0.0, disclosed by both sides). This differs from precedents P-0001 and P-0002 (PARTIAL_REFUND) because there the excess was left unexplained, whereas here the rider's own recorded instruction exonerates the whole excess.\n\nConfidence 0.90. The deciding facts are carried by weight-1.0 artifacts (EV-CHAT-00109, EV-GPS-00109, EV-FARE-00109, EV-TRIP-00109). The monetary effect of $3.15 is below the $8.00 execution threshold, so it executes automatically."
